{"isn-t":{"def":{"NONE":{"NONE":{"NONE":[["› short form of is not","（is not的縮略形式）"]]}}},"example":[["He isn't coming until tomorrow.","他明天才可以來。"]]},"isn-t-it-aren-t-they-just":{"def":{"NONE":{"NONE":{"NONE":[["› used to strongly agree with what someone has said about someone or something","（表示強烈贊同）可不是嘛"]]}}},"example":[["\"This is very expensive.\" \"Isn't it just?\"","「這太貴了。」「可不是嘛！」"]]}}